{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo is a cozy and contemplative game in which you accompany Mostro, a curious little dog who explores a vibrant jungle full of life, mountaineers, local animals, and fantastic creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles or enemies: just the calm of walking, discovering, and connecting with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo celebrates friendship, curiosity, and connection with the environment, inviting you to stop, breathe, and simply be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ideal experience for those seeking tranquility, exploration, and genuine emotions without rushing or violent challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041500?t=1773453599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041500/8949c8d5034dcd565c7d91e82d29b16485bba511/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773453599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041500/3536383b84491514696d6a1249e789cb05fdc07d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773453599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041500/3536383b84491514696d6a1249e789cb05fdc07d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773453599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description